# machine-local harness settings. .claude is a symlink to .agents (the
# harness-neutral real directory); ignoring only the .claude/ path (as some
# global gitignores do) stops working once .claude stops being a real
# directory, so this has to live in the repo's own .gitignore.
.agents/settings.local.json
